    rdfs:comment "American youth-development practitioner and nonprofit executive, 25+ years' experience; Executive Director, Community Action Inc. of Rock and Walworth Counties (Wisconsin); Member-At-Large, WISCAP (Wisconsin Community Action Program Association) board. Provides cultural-equity training and technical assistance to school districts, NGOs, and law-enforcement agencies across the Midwest."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Marc Perry"@en .

