thinkr:hasNamedEntityType a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:comment "GENERAL, top-level property — in practice, use a subclass-specific subproperty instead (e.g. thinkr:hasPersonEntityType for a thinkr:Human). This property exists mainly for uniform querying across ALL NamedEntity subclasses at once, once more than one exists."@en ;
    rdfs:domain thinkr:NamedEntity ;
    rdfs:range thinkr:NamedEntityType ;
    skos:prefLabel "has named entity type"@en .

thinkr:hasProfessionalRole a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain thinkr:Persona ;
    rdfs:range thinkr:ProfessionalRole ;
    skos:scopeNote "General-purpose grouping, NOT provenance-tracked — unlike memberOf/AffiliationNote (still pending its own design, see docs/sidecar-cleanup-handoff.md), this doesn't claim when/how the role was verified, just that it's a useful high-level label. DOMAIN CHANGED 2026-07-14 (Batch 3 of the Persona-centered refactor): was thinkr:Human, moved to thinkr:Persona — professional/public role tags are the same category of fact as hasPersonEntityType and hasHost/hasGuest, migrated in the same pass for consistency."@en .

thinkr:logicallyDisjointWith a owl:ObjectProperty,
        owl:SymmetricProperty ;
    rdfs:comment "Two individuals that cannot both be true/held/achieved at once — a genuinely stronger claim than thinkr:contrastsWith, which only flags a useful tension or disagreement without implying incompatibility. Each asserted pair should carry its own real justification in a scopeNote: definitional necessity (the two are opposite poles of the same axis by definition), causal/empirical reasoning (holding both is incoherent once the real causal chain between them is traced, even though people empirically do hold both), or both — not asserted as a bare, unexplained fact. General-purpose parent property; thinkr:diagonallyDisjointWith is its only sub-property for the ScenarioFacet grid case — see that property's own comment for why thinkr:xAxisDivergentFrom/thinkr:yAxisDivergentFrom, despite superficially similar names, are deliberately NOT sub-properties here."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "logically disjoint with"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Same tooling constraint as thinkr:convergesWith, verified there empirically 2026-07-11: this project's query tooling doesn't run a reasoner, so both directions must be explicitly asserted as real triples or querying from the 'other' side returns nothing, despite the property being formally symmetric."@en .

xsd:date a rdfs:Datatype .

