    rdfs:subClassOf thinkr:NamedEntityType ;
    skos:prefLabel "Person Entity Type"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Narrower than thinkr:NamedEntityType: specifically the categorization scheme for thinkr:Human individuals. A hypothetical future OrganizationEntityType would be a SIBLING of this, not a further subclass — see the OWL-depth-cap governance rule in CLAUDE.md."@en .

